3. The Operational “Relief Valve”: Mine Void Injection & AMD Abatement
A major flaw of traditional manufacturing is that when construction seasons freeze or product markets fluctuate, inventory piles up and facilities must shut down. This design incorporates a permanent, zero-cost operational relief valve: direct underground mine void filling.

