5. Strategic Summary & Deployment Pathway

By publishing this specification under an open hardware framework, regional stakeholders gain a fully realized blueprint for regional re-industrialization:

The Utility (e.g., AEP): Avoids multi-million-dollar capital landfill expansions, eliminates ongoing CCR liability, and frees up permitted acreage.
The Mine Owner: Obtains free, permanent stabilization of legacy underground workings and eliminates long-term AMD water monitoring liabilities.
The Local Economy: Establishes a commercial manufacturing engine producing high-margin 6,000 PSI Geocrete and domestic defense-critical minerals.
